      "text": "Traditionally, a lawyer or an associate would take days to read it, lying by lying, identifying what's unusual, what's risky and what could trap the client. Today, AI allows me to summarize such documents in minutes, highlighting clauses that deviate from standard practice. For example, in one transaction, AI instantly flagged an obscure line that shifted liability entirely onto the founder in case of tax claims. It would have taken hours for a human associate to catch it. AI did not make the decision for me, but it gave me the flashlight to see the risk clearly. I still had to argue, negotiate and protect my client's interests, but I did it with better speed and sharper focus.",
