      "end": 230.31,
      "duration": 61.14,
      "text": "Second, compliance management. In India, compliance is like a daily puzzle. Every company must file dozens of returns with the registrar of companies, the income tax department, the RBI and other regulators. Missing just one can mean penalties. Traditionally, this meant frantic calls, thick compliance calendars and the constant fear of a deadline slipping through the crux. With AI, I now build systems that track these obligations, send timely reminders and explain requirements in plain English. A young founder can receive a simple AI-generated note, your company must file form MGT-7 this month. This is your annual return, a snapshot of your company's shareholding and governance and that's it. No jargon, no confusion, just clarity. This is information accessibility in its purest sense.",
