      "text": "A client asks, how did we drop the non-compete clause in the last deal last year? In the past, I would send an intern into the abyss of files. Now I simply ask AI and it retrieves the precedence instantly. Efficiency is not just about saving time. It is about ensuring no knowledge ever goes unused. Sixth, strategy and decision making. Beyond the mechanical tasks, AI helps me think strategically by analyzing trends in judgments or regulatory updates. It helps me anticipate how laws are revolving. For example, when Indian courts started leaning towards stricter enforcement of shareholder rights, AI tool helped me map that trend quickly. This allowed me to advise my clients to renegotiate their contracts proactively.",
